	(text "S1 to 1 = WIDEBAND: bypass, 0.1-3 GHz, yellow-green LED D5.\nS1 to 3 = FILTER: SAW 433.92 MHz in front of the LNA (~0.4 MHz, NF ~5 dB), red LED D4.\n100k pull-downs keep the unselected control line at 0 V."
